# ==============================================================================
# THE HUNGRY LAB — CODEBASE CONTEXT (.context)
# ==============================================================================
# Master reference file for AI agents and developers. It details architecture,
# data models, domain workflows, API contracts, caching, dual-backend setup,
# and developer operational guides.
# ==============================================================================

## 1. Executive Summary

- **Project Name:** The Hungry Lab
- **Domain:** Food delivery & cloud kitchen online ordering platform.
- **Core Features:**
  - Dynamic interactive menu categorized with customizable add-ons (extra cheese, sauces, dips).
  - Client-side cart with persistent storage, coupled with strict server-side price recalculation to prevent price tampering.
  - Coupon & discount engine supporting both FLAT and PERCENTAGE discounts with minimum order value criteria.
  - Razorpay payment gateway integration with payment order generation and cryptographic webhook signature verification (HMAC-SHA256).
  - Dynamic hero carousel managed directly from the Admin Command Center with client-side image compression.
  - Live kitchen command center with auto-refreshing (5s short polling) live order queue for order status progression.
  - Media management using Backblaze B2 (S3-compatible) with presigned PUT/GET upload and download URLs.
  - In-memory / Upstash Redis caching for menu items and carousel options.
  - IP-based rate-limiting middleware on authentication and sensitive endpoints.
  - Automated database backup cron endpoint dumping tables into object storage.
  - Asynchronous email notifications on order confirmation using SMTP.
  - Role-based access control (RBAC) with stateless JWT tokens distinguishing `USER` and `ADMIN`.

