## 6. API Routing & Contracts

Base URL: `http://localhost:8080` (Spring Boot), `http://localhost:3000` (Express), or `VITE_API_URL` in production.

### 6.1 Authentication (`/api/auth`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | Public (Rate Limited) | Create user account; returns JWT & role |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | Public (Rate Limited) | Authenticate credentials; returns JWT & role |
| `GET` | `/api/auth/make-admin` | Public | Upgrades account to `ADMIN` by email |

### 6.2 Menu (`/api/menu`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/menu/` | Public | Returns menu items with addons (cached) |
| `GET` | `/api/menu/carousel` | Public | Returns active carousel banner images |

### 6.3 Orders (`/api/orders`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/orders/config` | Public | Returns public Razorpay key ID |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/` | Public/Auth | Places order, verifies pricing, creates Razorpay order |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/applycoupon` | Auth | Validates coupon code and returns discount values |
| `GET` | `/api/orders/user/:userId` | Auth (Self) | Returns authenticated user's order history |

### 6.4 Payment (`/api/payment`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/payment/webhook` | Raw Body | Validates HMAC-SHA256 signature and updates order status |

### 6.5 Admin (`/api/admin`) — Requires `ADMIN` Role
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders` | Fetch all historical orders |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders/active` | Fetch active kitchen orders |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/orders/:id/status` | Update order status |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/upload-url` | Generate Backblaze B2 S3 presigned upload URL |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/menu` | Add menu item (purges menu cache) |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/menu/:id` | Update menu item (purges menu cache) |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/menu/:id` | Delete menu item (purges menu cache) |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/addons` | List all available addons |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/addons` | Create new addon |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/addons/:id` | Update addon |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/addons/:id` | Delete addon |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/coupons` | Create coupon |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/carousel` | List all carousel banner images |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/carousel` | Add new carousel banner (purges carousel cache) |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/carousel/:id` | Toggle active status or order of carousel banner |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/carousel/:id` | Delete carousel banner |

### 6.6 Backup (`/api/backup`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/backup/database` | CRON_SECRET | Exports JSON dump of database tables to S3 bucket |

---

## 7. Frontend Architecture (Vue 3 SPA)

- **State Management:**
  - `stores/auth.js`: Token and user object in reactive state and `localStorage`. Supplies `getAuthHeaders()`.
  - `stores/cart.js`: Cart items, addon selection hashing, local subtotal computation, and payload formatting.
- **Dynamic API Target:**
  - Uses `const API_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:8080'` across all views and components.
- **Component Views:**
  - `HomeView.vue`: Features dynamic banner carousel with smooth indicators and quick order CTA.
  - `MenuView.vue`: Category pills, search bar, item cards with veg/non-veg dots, addon tags.
  - `CheckoutView.vue`: Cart review, coupon field, address inputs, Razorpay checkout modal trigger.
  - `HistoryView.vue`: List of previous orders with real-time status badges.
  - `AdminView.vue`: Tabbed command center covering Live Queue, History, Menu CRUD, Addon CRUD, Coupons, and Carousel management.

